## 6. Forward-Looking Statements

Following the successful Series D funding, MedSync Health is well-capitalized to execute its strategic plan. Our current cash on hand is **AED 441.00 million**, and our monthly burn rate is approximately **AED 1.87 million**, providing a runway of 23.5 months.

Our focus for FY 2025 will be:
1.  Achieving cash-flow positive operations by Q4 2025.
2.  Expanding our market share in the APAC region.
3.  Launching the next major version of MedSync Connect, focusing on AI-driven predictive analytics.

We are confident that our continued investment in R&D, coupled with our strong customer retention and high LTV:CAC ratio, will drive sustainable, profitable growth in the years to come.

